WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:02.823
Konnektora helps businesses
and event organizers

2
00:00:02.907 --> 00:00:05.527
connect with their communities.

3
00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:08.348
Promote your events and venue.

4
00:00:08.433 --> 00:00:11.363
Organize the information attendees need

5
00:00:11.433 --> 00:00:14.469
and increase your visibility
through shared interests.

6
00:00:14.554 --> 00:00:16.596
Before using business tools,

7
00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:21.182
make sure your account information
and admin permissions are correct.

8
00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:23.437
A well-designed event page
makes it easier for attendees

9
00:00:23.521 --> 00:00:25.390
to decide whether to join.

10
00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:28.311
Clearly provide the description,
date, time zone,

11
00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:31.466
location, and participation requirements.

12
00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:34.409
Choose whether your event is public,
requires approval,

13
00:00:34.493 --> 00:00:38.348
or is invite-only,
depending on your needs.

14
00:00:38.433 --> 00:00:41.315
Keep the information up to date
whenever changes occur.

15
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:45.031
Selecting interests related
to your event and venue

16
00:00:45.115 --> 00:00:48.315
helps relevant communities discover you.

17
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.670
Use topics that are genuinely relevant
to your content.

18
00:00:51.755 --> 00:00:54.410
Share useful information
with the community

19
00:00:54.494 --> 00:00:57.155
and communicate
respectfully with attendees.

20
00:00:57.233 --> 00:00:59.502
When managing invitations
and attendance records,

21
00:00:59.586 --> 00:01:02.542
only access information
you are authorized to view.

22
00:01:02.633 --> 00:01:05.517
Authorized teams can manage
invitations and attendance records,

23
00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:10.015
as well as guest lists and
check-in tools for eligible accounts.

24
00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:15.948
The availability of QR and NFC options
depends on device and browser support.

25
00:01:16.033 --> 00:01:17.941
When reviewing analytics,

26
00:01:18.025 --> 00:01:20.715
make sure you are viewing data
for the relevant event or venue.

27
00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:26.013
If you're unsure how to proceed,
visit the Help Center or contact support.

